# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Trained model artifacts that the API loads at runtime MUST be committed, or a
# fresh deploy (Railway/Render/Docker) has nothing to load. These negations come
# LAST so they override the broad *.keras / *.joblib / *.zip rules above.
# (models/trained|checkpoints|experiments stay ignored -- those are scratch dirs.)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
!models/**/*.keras
!models/**/*.joblib
!models/optimizer/ppo_model.zip
